  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0: Added Net 10 support; new MiddlewareAnalysisExtensions and QueryCommandAnalysisExtensions extension helpers for comprehensive type normalization. Fixed edge case bug in RegistrationService with generic type definitions. New AnalyzerExample demonstrates analyzer capabilities across 92 components in 5 projects with enhanced debugging tools and missing handler detection. Improved developer experience with visual missing handler identification and comprehensive pipeline analysis capabilities.",
